  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "미르시티는 왜 이렇게\n집을 구하기가 어려운 거야!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBF8B974C2DCD2F0B2940020C65C0020C774B807AC8C000AC9D1C7440020AD6CD558AE30AC000020C5B4B824C6B40020AC70C57C002100100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "미르시티에는\n멋진 명소가 잔뜩 있잖아.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBF8B974C2DCD2F0C5D0B294000ABA4BC9C40020BA85C18CAC000020C794B7290020C788C796C544002E00100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "눈길이 가는 곳이 너무 많아서\n이사할 곳을 도저히 못 정하겠어!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B208AE38C7740020AC00B2940020ACF3C7740020B108BB340020B9CEC544C11C000AC774C0ACD5600020ACF3C7440020B3C4C800D7880020BABB0020C815D558ACA0C5B4002100100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "내가 찾고 있는 집의 조건을\n설명해 줄게.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0B4AC000020CC3EACE00020C788B2940020C9D1C7580020C870AC74C744000AC124BA85D5740020C904AC8C002E00100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "우선 미르 하면 프리즘타워 아니겠어!\n그러니까 <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>타워가 코앞인 곳<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>에 살고 싶어.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6B0C1200020BBF8B9740020D558BA740020D504B9ACC998D0C0C6CC0020C544B2C8ACA0C5B40021000AADF8B7ECB2C8AE4C002000100002FF000006D0C0C6CCAC000020CF54C55EC7780020ACF300100002FF000000C5D00020C0B4ACE00020C2F6C5B4002E00100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그리고 미르는 쉐종 운하로도 유명하잖아!\n우아하게 흐르는 <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>운하 주변<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>이면 좋겠어.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B9ACACE00020BBF8B974B2940020C250C8850020C6B4D558B85CB3C40020C720BA85D558C796C5440021000AC6B0C544D558AC8C0020D750B974B294002000100002FF000006C6B4D5580020C8FCBCC000100002FF000000C774BA740020C88BACA0C5B4002E00100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "또, 일레도리자드를 위해 <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>옥상<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>이 있어야 해!\n햇볕이 잘 드는 곳을 좋아하거든.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B610002C0020C77CB808B3C4B9ACC790B4DCB97C0020C704D574002000100002FF000006C625C0C100100002FF000000C7740020C788C5B4C57C0020D5740021000AD587BCD5C7740020C7980020B4DCB2940020ACF3C7440020C88BC544D558AC70B4E0002E00100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아, 함께 느긋하게 지낼 수 있게 옥상에\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>파라솔<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>과 <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>테이블<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>도 있으면 좋겠다.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 14,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544002C0020D568AED80020B290AE0BD558AC8C0020C9C0B0BC0020C2180020C788AC8C0020C625C0C1C5D0000A00100002FF000006D30CB77CC19400100002FF000000ACFC002000100002FF000006D14CC774BE1400100002FF000000B3C40020C788C73CBA740020C88BACA0B2E4002E00100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "마지막으로 <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>포켓몬센터<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>와 <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>카페<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>가\n적당히 가까운 곳에 있으면 좋겠어.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 14,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9C8C9C0B9C9C73CB85C002000100002FF000006D3ECCF13BAACC13CD13000100002FF000000C640002000100002FF000006CE74D39800100002FF000000AC00000AC801B2F9D7880020AC00AE4CC6B40020ACF3C5D00020C788C73CBA740020C88BACA0C5B4002E00100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "내가 바라는 게 너무 많은 건가?\n도통 마음에 드는 집을 못 구하겠더라고.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0B4AC000020BC14B77CB2940020AC8C0020B108BB340020B9CEC7400020AC74AC00003F000AB3C4D1B50020B9C8C74CC5D00020B4DCB2940020C9D1C7440020BABB0020AD6CD558ACA0B354B77CACE0002E00100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그러니까 너도\n이사할 집을 찾는 걸 좀 도와주라.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7ECB2C8AE4C0020B108B3C4000AC774C0ACD5600020C9D1C7440020CC3EB2940020AC780020C8800020B3C4C640C8FCB77C002E00100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "알았지, 베이비? 나와 일레도리자드를 위해\n괜찮은 집을 찾아 줘!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C54CC558C9C0002C0020BCA0C774BE44003F0020B098C6400020C77CB808B3C4B9ACC790B4DCB97C0020C704D574000AAD1CCC2EC7400020C9D1C7440020CC3EC5440020C918002100100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "내가 찾고 있는 집은 프리즘타워가 코앞인\n쉐종 운하변 근처!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n파라솔과 테이블이 딸린 옥상이 있고\n포켓몬센터와 카페가 가까웠으면 좋겠어!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "프리즘타워가 코앞인\n쉐종 운하변 근처.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n파라솔과 테이블이 딸린 옥상...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n조건에 딱 맞는 장소를 찾았다!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D504B9ACC998D0C0C6CCAC000020CF54C55EC778000AC250C8850020C6B4D558BCC00020ADFCCC98002E00100001BE00000AD30CB77CC194ACFC0020D14CC774BE14C7740020B538B9B00020C625C0C1002E002E002E00100001BE01000AC870AC74C5D00020B5310020B9DEB2940020C7A5C18CB97C0020CC3EC558B2E400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "헤이, 헤이, 헤이!\n여기가 일레도리자드에게 딱 맞는 집이라고?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D5E4C774002C0020D5E4C774002C0020D5E4C7740021000AC5ECAE30AC000020C77CB808B3C4B9ACC790B4DCC5D0AC8C0020B5310020B9DEB2940020C9D1C774B77CACE0003F00100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "여... 여기는...!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5EC002E002E002E0020C5ECAE30B294002E002E002E002100100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "코앞에 프리즘타워!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CF54C55EC5D00020D504B9ACC998D0C0C6CC002100100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "쉐종 운하가 바로 옆인 데다가!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C250C8850020C6B4D558AC000020BC14B85C0020C606C7780020B370B2E4AC00002100100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "파라솔과 테이블이 있는 옥상까지!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D30CB77CC194ACFC0020D14CC774BE14C7740020C788B2940020C625C0C1AE4CC9C0002100100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬센터와 카페도 진짜 가깝잖아!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAACC13CD130C6400020CE74D398B3C40020C9C4C9DC0020AC00AE5DC796C544002100100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "여기야! 무조건 여기로 해야겠어!\n바로 관리인과 이야기하고 올게!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5ECAE30C57C00210020BB34C870AC740020C5ECAE30B85C0020D574C57CACA0C5B40021000ABC14B85C0020AD00B9ACC778ACFC0020C774C57CAE30D558ACE00020C62CAC8C002100100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "만세!\n바로 입주할 수 있대!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9CCC1380021000ABC14B85C0020C785C8FCD5600020C2180020C788B300002100100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "일레도리자드도\n매우 만족스러운 모양이야!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C77CB808B3C4B9ACC790B4DCB3C4000AB9E4C6B00020B9CCC871C2A4B7ECC6B40020BAA8C591C774C57C002100100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "리리리!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 2164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9ACB9ACB9AC00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "문제는 집세가... 너무 비싸단 말이지.\n집세를 내고 나면 아무것도 못 사겠는걸.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 2176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB38C81CB2940020C9D1C138AC00002E002E002E0020B108BB340020BE44C2F8B2E80020B9D0C774C9C0002E000AC9D1C138B97C0020B0B4ACE00020B098BA740020C544BB34AC83B3C40020BABB0020C0ACACA0B294AC78002E00100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "리리리...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 2276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9ACB9ACB9AC002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "좋아, 이 집으로 하겠어!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C88BC544002C0020C7740020C9D1C73CB85C0020D558ACA0C5B4002100100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사랑스러운 일레도리자드와 함께 살 집으로\n여기보다 좋은 곳은 없을 테니까!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACB791C2A4B7ECC6B40020C77CB808B3C4B9ACC790B4DCC6400020D568AED80020C0B40020C9D1C73CB85C000AC5ECAE30BCF4B2E40020C88BC7400020ACF3C7400020C5C6C7440020D14CB2C8AE4C002100100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이사할 집을 찾아 줘서 고마워!\n돈은... ZA로열에서 열심히 벌어야지, 뭐!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774C0ACD5600020C9D1C7440020CC3EC5440020C918C11C0020ACE0B9C8C6CC0021000AB3C8C740002E002E002E0020005A0041B85CC5F4C5D0C11C0020C5F4C2ECD7880020BC8CC5B4C57CC9C0002C0020BB50002100100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿 ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00200000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "일레도리자드가 편하게 일광욕을 하고 있어!\n이 아이를 위해서라면 난 뭐든 할 수 있다고!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C77CB808B3C4B9ACC790B4DCAC000020D3B8D558AC8C0020C77CAD11C695C7440020D558ACE00020C788C5B40021000AC7740020C544C774B97C0020C704D574C11CB77CBA740020B09C0020BB50B4E00020D5600020C2180020C788B2E4ACE0002100100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "리리리!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9ACB9ACB9AC00210000",
